  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Finance Against Slavery and Trafficking (FAST)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The FAST project aims to reduce modern slavery by leveraging the financial sector for global economic system change. The objective is disruption of business reliance on modern slavery. The aim of the project is reduced risk of modern slavery through incorporation of modern slavery risks into financial sector regulation and practice.</narrative>
  </description>
